你哪里不舒服？","audio_pinyin":"nǐ nǎ lǐ bù shū fu ？","options":[{"zh":"我要买苹果。","pinyin":"wǒ yào mǎi píng guǒ 。"},{"zh":"我头疼，还有点儿发烧。","pinyin":"wǒ tóu téng ， hái yǒu diǎnr fā shāo 。"},{"zh":"我在学校。","pinyin":"wǒ zài xué xiào 。"}],"answer":"我头疼，还有点儿发烧。","explain":{"question_id":"Bagian mana yang tidak enak?","answer_id":"Kepalaku sakit, dan agak demam."}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-l2","type":"audio_dialog_question_mcq","skill":"listening","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","turns":[{"who":"男","zh":"你怎么了？","pinyin":"nǐ zěn me le ？"},{"who":"女","zh":"我感冒了，头很疼。","pinyin":"wǒ gǎn mào le ， tóu hěn téng 。"}],"question":"女的怎么了？","question_pinyin":"nǚ de zěn me le ？","options":[{"zh":"累了","pinyin":"lèi le"},{"zh":"感冒了","pinyin":"gǎn mào le"},{"zh":"饿了","pinyin":"è le"}],"answer":"感冒了","explain":{"text_id":"Laki-laki: Kamu kenapa? / Perempuan: Aku masuk angin, kepalaku sangat sakit.","question_id":"Si perempuan kenapa?","answer_id":"Masuk angin"}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-l3","type":"audio_dialog_question_mcq","skill":"listening","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","turns":[{"who":"女","zh":"医生，这个药怎么吃？","pinyin":"yī shēng ， zhè ge yào zěn me chī ？"},{"who":"男","zh":"一天三次，饭后吃。","pinyin":"yì tiān sān cì ， fàn hòu chī 。"}],"question":"这个药一天吃几次？","question_pinyin":"zhè ge yào yì tiān chī jǐ cì ？","options":[{"zh":"一次","pinyin":"yí cì"},{"zh":"三次","pinyin":"sān cì"},{"zh":"两次","pinyin":"liǎng cì"}],"answer":"三次","explain":{"text_id":"Perempuan: Dokter, obat ini cara minumnya bagaimana? / Laki-laki: Tiga kali sehari, diminum setelah makan.","question_id":"Obat ini diminum berapa kali sehari?","answer_id":"Tiga kali"}}],"reading":[{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-r1","type":"cloze_wordbank","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"你生病了，应该去（　）。","options":[{"word":"学校","pinyin":"xué xiào"},{"word":"医院","pinyin":"yī yuàn"},{"word":"饭馆","pinyin":"fàn guǎn"},{"word":"商店","pinyin":"shāng diàn"}],"answer":"医院","explain":{"zh":"你生病了，应该去医院。","pinyin":"nǐ shēng bìng le ， yīng gāi qù yī yuàn 。","id":"Kamu sakit, sebaiknya pergi ke rumah sakit."}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-r2","type":"cloze_wordbank","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"这个药一天吃三（　）。","options":[{"word":"条","pinyin":"tiáo"},{"word":"次","pinyin":"cì"},{"word":"件","pinyin":"jiàn"},{"word":"岁","pinyin":"suì"}],"answer":"次","explain":{"zh":"这个药一天吃三次。","pinyin":"zhè ge yào yì tiān chī sān cì 。","id":"Obat ini diminum tiga kali sehari."}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-r3","type":"short_text_mcq","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","text":"我昨天开始发烧，头也很疼。今天我去医院看病。医生说我感冒了，让我多喝水，多休息，还要吃药。","text_pinyin":"wǒ zuó tiān kāi shǐ fā shāo ， tóu yě hěn téng 。 jīn tiān wǒ qù yī yuàn kàn bìng 。 yī shēng shuō wǒ gǎn mào le ， ràng wǒ duō hē shuǐ ， duō xiū xi ， hái yào chī yào 。","question":"★ 医生让他做什么？","question_pinyin":"yī shēng ràng tā zuò shén me ？","options":[{"zh":"去学校上课","pinyin":"qù xué xiào shàng kè"},{"zh":"多休息，多喝水，吃药","pinyin":"duō xiū xi ， duō hē shuǐ ， chī yào"},{"zh":"多吃饭，少喝水","pinyin":"duō chī fàn ， shǎo hē shuǐ"}],"answer":"多休息，多喝水，吃药","explain":{"text_id":"Sejak kemarin aku demam dan kepalaku juga sakit. Hari ini aku pergi ke rumah sakit berobat. Dokter bilang aku masuk angin, menyuruhku banyak minum air, banyak istirahat, dan minum obat.","question_id":"Apa yang dokter suruh dia lakukan?","answer_id":"Banyak istirahat, banyak minum air, dan minum obat"}}],"writing":[{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-w1","type":"order_sentence","skill":"writing","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"Bagian mana yang tidak enak?","tokens":["你","哪里","不","舒服","？"],"answer":"你哪里不舒服？","explain":{"zh":"你哪里不舒服？","pinyin":"nǐ nǎ lǐ bù shū fu ？","id":"Bagian mana yang tidak enak?"}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-w2","type":"order_sentence","skill":"writing","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"Dokter menyuruhku banyak istirahat.","tokens":["医生","让","我","多","休息","。"],"answer":"医生让我多休息。","explain":{"zh":"医生让我多休息。","pinyin":"yī shēng ràng wǒ duō xiū xi 。","id":"Dokter menyuruhku banyak istirahat."}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-w3","type":"order_sentence","skill":"writing","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"Sudah minum obat?","tokens":["你","吃","药","了","吗","？"],"answer":"你吃药了吗？","explain":{"zh":"你吃药了吗？","pinyin":"nǐ chī yào le ma ？","id":"Sudah minum obat?"}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-w4","type":"order_sentence","skill":"writing","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"Jangan khawatir.","tokens":["你","不要","担心","。"],"answer":"你不要担心。","explain":{"zh":"你不要担心。","pinyin":"nǐ bú yào dān xīn 。","id":"Jangan khawatir."}},{"id":"ls-rumah-sakit-w5","type":"order_sentence","skill":"writing","level":3,"lesson":"rumah-sakit","stem":"Aku ingin pergi ke rumah sakit untuk berobat.","tokens":["我","想","去","医院","看病","。"],"answer":"我想去医院看病。","explain":{"zh":"我想去医院看病。","pinyin":"wǒ xiǎng qù yī yuàn kàn bìng 。","id":"Aku ingin pergi ke rumah sakit untuk berobat."}}]},"speaking":[{"zh":"你哪里不舒服？","id":"Bagian mana yang tidak enak?","pinyin":"nǐ nǎ lǐ bù shū fu ？","tokens":["你","哪里","不","舒服","？"],"tokenPinyin":["nǐ","nǎlǐ","bù","shūfu",""],"order":true,"alt":[]},{"zh":"我头疼，还发烧了。","id":"Kepalaku sakit, dan juga demam.","pinyin":"wǒ tóu téng ， hái fā shāo le 。","tokens":["我","头","疼","，","还","发烧","了","。"],"tokenPinyin":["wǒ","tóu","téng","","hái","fāshāo","le",""],"order":false,"alt":[]},{"zh":"你不要担心。","id":"Jangan khawatir.","pinyin":"nǐ bú yào dān xīn 。","tokens":["你","不要","担心","。"],"tokenPinyin":["nǐ","búyào","dānxīn",""],"order":true,"alt":[]}]}]